-- Q1215: SOC Testing Controls [hard/L1]
-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Per AT-C Section 205.35 (Examination Engagements), SOC testing documentation must include the population definition, sample selection method and rationale, evidence obtained, test results including deviations, and the practitioner''s conclusion for each control. These elements demonstrate proper planning and sufficient evidence.
Wrong (A): A service organization''s competitive analysis and market position are business strategy documents, not required elements of SOC testing workpapers.
Wrong (B): Predicting future control effectiveness based on trends is not a documentation requirement; workpapers document historical testing results, not forecasts.
