-- Issues: #3
UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under the inclusive method per SSAE 18 (AT-C Section 320.14), the subservice organization''s relevant controls are included within the SOC examination scope, and the practitioner tests those controls directly. The resulting opinion covers the combined control environment of both organizations.
Wrong (A): Excluding the subservice organization''s controls and relying on management''s representation describes the carve-out method, not the inclusive method.
